# 支持库工程仓库：只入源码、规格与工具脚本，编译产物与第三方包靠构建重新获取。

# ============ 产物目录 ============
out/
obj/
bin/
build/
dist/
Debug/
Release/
x64/
Win32/
ipch/
static_lib/
node_modules/
.vs/
.idea/
edge_cache/
EBWebView/
.cache/
tmp/
temp/
Temp/
scratch/

# ============ 第三方依赖包（按各自 README 的取包方式重新下载）============
*/third_party/

# ============ 编译产物文件 ============
*.obj
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.exp
*.lib
*.lnt
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.map
*.exe
*.dll
*.res
*.msi
*.tsbuildinfo

# ============ 易语言工程与模块二进制（源码一律看导出的 txt）============
*.e
*.ec
*.ecode
*.fnr
# 例外：工程验收用的测试工程要留档
!测试/测试.e

# ============ 压缩包与日志 ============
*.7z
*.rar
*.zip
*.gz
*.xz
*.log
*.bak
*.old
*.tmp
*.temp
*.~*
*.browser_data
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ============ 系统文件 ============
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
